#ROOMS

#86000
"War-torn Battlefield"
"The earth here is muddy and bloodstained; the former caused by the macabre
dance of battle and the latter by its horrific aftermath.  Corpses of various
sizes and shapes litter the ground, their discarded weapons bent and broken in
testament to the futility of their wielder's efforts.  To the north, the
treacherous ground slopes sharply downward toward the river.  East and west
continue alongside the river, signs of battle stretching as far as the trees
and hills allow you to see.  The ground rises gently southward, leading back
toward the Unity front line.
"
"search saddles
move ogre
get axe (from dwarf)
"
