#86003
"War-torn Battlefield"
"This area of the battlefield still has grass sprouting from the ground, rather
than torn up and mixed with mud.  Several long swaths of grass, roughly a foot
wide, are trampled down as if by some tremendous weight.  To the north you see
the remains of a bridge jutting about a foot out from the bank, with its stone
supports smashed and crumbled onto the bank of the river.  To the west is the
aftermath of a sizable skirmish, and to the east is a small copse of trees. 
The way south is blocked by a massive wall of logs that protects a tall wooden
watchtower.
"
""
33030144 0
2 6 0
D1
""
""
0 -1 86005 0 6
D3
""
