#86005
"Copse of Trees near a Battlefield"
"This copse of trees extends like an arm from the forest to the southeast,
dense and difficult to traverse.  Battle seems to not have travelled into this
pine-needle laced grove, as the ground and trees are mostly undisturbed.  The
river to the north is higher here than it is to the northwest, as a partial
dam of rock and wood is slowing the flow of water significantly.  To the west
lies an open field, while to the east is a small clearing before the forest
begins in earnest.  To the south is a massive wall of linked logs.
"
"remove north and make a jump acode
search quiver for nice arrows
"
